    "body": "@mikewest @annevk I have no idea whether it is of interest to you, but I had been working on an interoperability test for the in-progress async cookies API and &lt;meta http-equiv=\"set-cookie\" ... &gt; -- see https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/594890/21/third_party/WebKit/LayoutTests/external/wpt/async_cookies/cookie_store_tests.tentative.html#212\r\nand\r\nhttps://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/594890/21/third_party/WebKit/LayoutTests/external/wpt/async_cookies/cookie_store_tests.tentative.html#329\r\n\r\nSince this no longer works in Chromium at HEAD I had intended to abandon it, but if there is interest I can see about preserving it with a \"historical\" intent/to ensure interoperability in browsers still honoring that tag",
