    "created_at": "2017-12-19T00:17:02Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-12-19T00:17:02Z",
    "body": "It feels like we're at a point where we have 1 removal and 2 support-for-removal, so it'd be reasonable to remove from the spec now. But being conservative doesn't hurt, as long as we remember to follow up.\r\n\r\nI'll set a reminder for Chrome 65 time (late February/early March) to come back to this thread. In the meantime, @dveditz, are you interested in working on a Firefox patch to kill meta set-cookie around the same time as Chrome?",
